  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Surgery Specialities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Consolidating Training and Research in Surgery and Related Specialities project aims to strengthen the surgical training programmes in Malawi. The project will promote clinical training and research within a panel of surgical and related specialties, namely general surgery, orthopedics, neurosurgery, radiology and anesthesiology.</narrative>
  </description>
